    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 213]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Provincial Councils and Local Government on20th of October, 2017.\n\n(Published in the Gazette on October 04, 2017)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed.\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nLOCAL AUTHORITIES(SPECIAL PROVISIONS)\n\nto provide for calling of fresh nominations and the holding of elections inrespect of two Pradeshiya Sabhas in the Northern Province whereelections to such sabhas have been postponed due to unforeseen and urgentcircumstances; and to provide for matters connected therewith or incidentalthereto.\n\n2 PL 010388\u2014\u2013510 (10/2017)\n\n1Local Authorities (Special Provisions)\n\n2 PL 010388\u2014\u2013510 (10/2017)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 1 / 2017\n\nAN ACT TO PROVIDE FOR CALLING OF FRESH NOMINATIONS AND THE\n\nHOLDING OF ELECTIONS IN RESPECT OF TWO PRADESHIYA SABHAS IN\n\nTHE NORTHERN PROVINCE WHERE ELECTIONS TO SUCH SABHAS HAVE\n\nBEEN POSTPONED DUE TO UNFORESEEN AND URGENT CIRCUMSTANCES;\n\nAND TO PROVIDE FOR MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR INCIDENTAL\n\nTHERETO.\n\nWHEREAS notices were published under section 26 of theLocal Authorities Elections Ordinance, that nominationswill be received in respect of elections to Pudukudiruppuand Maritimepattu Pradeshiya Sabhas in the NorthernProvince:\n\nAND WHEREAS the dates of polls fixed for the holding ofelections for the aforesaid Pradeshiya Sabhas were postponedfrom time to time due to unforeseen and urgent circumstancesby Orders made under subsection (3) of section 38 of theLocal Authorities Elections Ordinance:"
