    "chunk_size_bytes": 2039,
    "chunk_text": "2.(1) From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as now are members of the\u201cMohan Lanka Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cFoundation \u201c) or shall hereafter be admitted as members ofthe Corporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporatewith perpetual succession, under the name and style of the\u201cMohan Lanka Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cCorporation\u201d) and by that name may sue and be sued, withfull power and authority to have and use a common seal andto alter the same at its pleasure.\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\n25\n\nIncorporationof the MohanLankaFoundation.\n\n30\n\n2Mohan Lanka Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3. (1) The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be \u2013\n\n(a)to grant various helps beginning from schooleducation to university education to the childrenof families who face economic hardships;\n\n(b)to facilitate and sponsor the children who have losttheir parents;\n\n(c)to facilitate and sponsor the differently ablechildren;\n\n(d)to conduct free medical camps;\n\n(e)to launch disaster management programmes andprovide resources needful for such programmes;\n\n(f)to grant financial and meterial assistance to theyouth clubs and sports clubs; and\n\n(g)to do all such other acts and things as are necessaryfor an incidental or conducive to the attainment ofthe above objects.\n\n(2) In the implementation of the objects specified insubsection (1) the Corporation shall ensure that suchimplementation shall be carried out without anydiscrimination based on race, religion, language, caste, sex,political opinion, place of birth or any of such grounds.\n\n4. The objects of the Corporation shall be carried out insuch manner so as not to create any conflict between thework of the Corporation and any work being carried outsimultaneously by any Ministry or Department of theGovernment or any Provincial Council.\n\nCorporationto ensure noconflict withworkMinistry orDepartmentof the CentralGovernmentor Province."
  },
