    "chunk_text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Natha AhasthanaInternational Buddhist Meditation Centre PerformanceSociety (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2017.\n\nShort Title.\n\nIncorporationof theSri NathaAhasthanaInternationalBuddhistMeditationCentrePerformaceSociety.\n\nPreamble.\n\n20\n\n25\n\nSri Natha Ahasthana International BuddhistMeditation Centre Performance Society(Incorporation)\n\n2\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n(2) The Corporation shall be deemed to be a VoluntarySocial Services Organization within the meaning, and forthe purpose of the Voluntary Social Services Organizations(Registration and Supervision) Act, No. 31 of 1980 and theprovisions of that Act shall apply to and in relation to themanagement of the affairs of the Corporation.\n\n3.(1) The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to provide opportunities for fourfold groups torealize the nirvana;\n\n(b)to work for the stability of the Buddha Sasana;\n\n(c)to improve, maintain and protect the centre;\n\n(d)to provide four requisites of robes, alms(Vegetarian), hermitage and drinks offerings forfourfold groups of Bhikku, Bhikkuni, laymen andlaywomen who dwell at the centre;\n\n(e)to empower and assist laymen and laywomen toimprove their virtue (Sheela), concentration(Samadhi) and wisdom (Pragna);\n\n(f)to organize meditation programs for laymen andlaywomen on every full moon poya day; and\n\n(g)to do all such other acts and things as are necessaryfor and incidental or conducive to the attainmentof the objects of the Corporation.\n\n(2) In the implementation of the objects specified insubsection (1) the Corporation shall ensure that suchimplementation shall be carried out without anydiscrimination based on race, religion, language, caste, sex,political opinion, place of birth or any of such grounds.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n25\n\n3Sri Natha Ahasthana International BuddhistMeditation Centre Performance Society(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15"
