    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nAPPROPRIATION (AMENDMENT)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Finance and Mass Media on 04th of December, 2017\n\n(Published in the Gazette on November 17, 2017)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nto amend the Appropriation Act, No. 24 of 2016.\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n2-2dp\n\n2-\n\n2\u2014PL 010520\u2014510 (12/2017)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 221]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause amends section 2 of the Appropriation Act, No. 24 of 2016 and thelegal effect of that section as amended is to increase the borrowing limit of the Governmentfor year 2017.\n\nAppropriation (Amendment)1\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 58/2017\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE APPROPRIATION ACT, NO. 24 OF 2016\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Appropriation(Amendment) Act, No. of 2017.\n\n2.Section 2 of the Appropriation Act, No. 24 of 2016 ishereby amended in subsection (1) of that section, by thesubstitution in paragraph (b) of that subsection for the words\u201cshall not exceed rupees one thousand five hundred seventynine billion one hundred ten million four hundred thirty sixthousand\u201d, of the words \u201cshall not exceed rupees one thousandsix hundred twenty nine billion\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\nPL 010459 \u2014475 (11/2017)\n\nSinhala text toprevail in caseofinconsistency.\n\nAmendment ofsection 2 of Act,No. 24 of 2016.\n