    "md5": "8c2141c1af9629f2918895e01c89c3f9",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1969,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Pothuwatawana MahaViharaya Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2018.\n\n(2) The Corporation shall be deemed to be a charitableorganization.\n\nShort title.\n\nPreamble.\n\nIncorporationof thePothuwatawanaMahaViharaya.\n\n25\n\n2Pothuwatawana Maha Viharaya Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be :\u2014\n\n(a) to provide assistance to improve dhamma education,knowledge, attitudes, skills of Buddhists and theirchildren by initiation, continuation and promotionof training courses on Theravada Buddhism;\n\n(b) to take action to strengthen reconciliation amongeach other by creation of friendship, goodwill, peace,understanding and co-operation among ethnic andreligious groups since this is an area with multi ethnicand multi religious co-existence;\n\n(c) to take action to give priority to activities such asattracting attendance of local and foreign scholarsand devotees as well as followers with a view to furtherpromoting Buddhist doctrine and culture byconducting Buddhist sermons, conferences,discussions and other pertinent programmes andfacilitating them etc., since this is a Buddhist templefully facilitated and situated at a quiet lication inclose proximity to the main airport;\n\n(d) to establish a just society through organizing,directing and practicing the sil campaign, meditationprogrammes, and Bodhi Poojas;\n\n(e) to take necessary action to eradicate any potentialthreats to the Buddhism and the nation;\n\n(f) to train local and foreign missionaries from amongboth laymen and clergymen; and\n\n(g) to do all such other acts and things as are necessaryfor and incidential or conducive to the attainment ofthe above objects.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n30\n\nPothuwatawana Maha Viharaya Foundation(Incorporation)3\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25"
  },
