    "chunk_text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so may persons as now are members of the NimalRupasinghe Friendship Foundation (hereinafter referred to asthe \u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereinafter be admitted as membersof the \u201cNimal Rupasinghe Friendship Foundation\u201d(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) and by thatname may sue and be sued with full power and authority to haveand use a common seal and to alter the same at its pleasure.\n\n(a) To implement programmes and to give guidance tocreate a good atmosphere to build up peace andharmony in all communities and ethnic groups tolive as Sri Lankans;\n\nShort title.\n\nPreamble.\n\nIncorporationof the NimalRupasinghefriendshipFoundation.\n\n25\n\nThe generalobjects of theCorporation.\n\n2Nimal Rupasinghe Friendship Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(b) to implement programmes to educate the Sri Lankansociety of the field of Law without any discriminationgiving priority to the fact that \u201cIgnorance of the Lawis not an excuse\u201d ;\n\n(c) to provide necessary educational equipments andother relevent facilities for the improvement of theeducational knowledge of the children, through theprogramme of Sisu Sahana Mavupiya KapakaruShisya Adara wedasatahana\u201d;\n\n(d) printing publication and distribution of books,Magazines in order to promote the Education;\n\n(e) to provide educational facilites and also to giveknowledge for the education of the Pre-schoolchildren;\n\n(f) to provide Library facilities including books for thelearning children to gain knowledge;\n\n(g) to organize seminars and workshops for the G.C.E.O/L and A/L students to improve their knowledge ofeducation;\n\n(h) to provide facilities for the education of the childrenwith special needs;\n\n(i) to conduct lectures, seminars, discussions exhibitionsand carnivals to promote the objects of thecorporation.\n\n(j) to liaise and co-ordinate with other local and foreigninstitutions which have similar objectives.\n\nNimal Rupasinghe Friendship Foundation(Incorporation)3\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25"
