    "chunk_text": "SectionTitlePageTHE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of January 26, 2018\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 01. 02. 2018)\n\nDEMUTUALIZATION OF THE COLOMBOSTOCK EXCHANGE\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of National Policies andEconomic Affairs\n\nto provide for the demutualization of the Colombo Stock Exchange by theconversion of the Colombo Stock Exchange which is a company limitedby guarantee, to a company limited by shares; and to provide for mattersconnected therewith or incidental thereto.\n\nPrice : Rs. 28.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1Demutualization of the ColomboStock Exchange\n\n2 PL 010619\u2014475 (01/2018)\n\nShort titleand date ofoperation.5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 26/2010.\n\nAN ACT TO PROVIDE FOR THE DEMUTUALIZATION OF THE COLOMBO STOCKEXCHANGE BY THE CONVERSION OF THE COLOMBO STOCK EXCHANGE\n\nWHICH IS A COMPANY LIMITED BY GUARANTEE, TO A COMPANY LIMITED\n\nBY SHARES; AND TO PROVIDE FOR MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH\n\nOR INCIDENTAL THERETO.\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Demutualization of theColombo Stock Exchange Act, No. of 2018 and shallcome into operation, on such date appointed by the Minister(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cappointed date\u201d) by orderpublished in the Gazatte.\n\n2.The objective of this Act shall be to demutualizethe Colombo Stock Exchange which is a company limitedby guarantee and lincensed as a stock exchange under theSecurities and Exchange Commission of Sri LankaAct, No. 36 of 1987 by conversion in terms of the provisionsof this Act to a company limited by shares."
