    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPresented by the Minister of Plantation Industrieson 09th of May, 2018\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 246]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n(Published in the Gazette on March 12, 2018)\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nSRI LANKA TEA BOARD (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Sri Lanka Tea Board Law, No. 14 of 1975\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause inserts a new section 6A to the Sri Lanka Tea Board Law, No.14of 1975 in order to appoint a Working Director to the Board and to provide for mattersrelated thereto.\n\nSri Lanka Tea Board (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 27/2017\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE SRI LANKA TEA BOARDLAW, NO. 14 OF 1975\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka Tea Board(Amendment) Act, No. of 2018.\n\n2.The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 6 of the Sri Lanka Tea Board Law,No. 14 of 1975 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) and shall have effect as section 6A of thatenactment:\u2014\n\n6A. (1) The Minister may appoint to theBoard, a Working Director other than themembers referred to in section 6 from amongpersons who have had wide experience in thearea of tea industry.\n\n(2) The Working Director shall\u2013\n\n(a)be a full time officer;\n\n(b)assist the Chairman in thepromotion of the development ofthe tea industry within andoutside Sri Lanka; and\n\n(c)assist the Chairman in theadministration, management andoperation of the affairs of theBoard including the co-ordinationof the activities of the Board.\n\nShort title.\n\nInsertion ofnew section6A in LawNo. 14 of1975.\n\n15\n\n20\n\n\u201cWorkingDirector ofthe Board.\n\n25\n\n2Sri Lanka Tea Board (Amendment)"
