e words \u201cParliament, in the mannerprovided in paragraph (3) of this Article\u201d;\n\n(iii)the insertion of the word \u201cordinarily\u201dimmediately before the words \u201chold office\u201din paragraph (2) of Article 30;\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAmendment ofArticle 4 of theConstitution."
