n\n\u201cFirstly-Every person holding any officein Sri Lanka by virtue of any30\n\n\u201c\u201cThisIsland\u201d and\u201cSri Lanka.\n\n\u201cPresident.\n\nReplacementof section 15of theprincipalenactment.\n\nReplacementof section 16of theprincipalenactment."
