    "chunk_text": "\u201c(7) Where any movable property owned by acompany is subject to a floating charge which isregistered under the Secured Transactions Act,No. of 2019, the provisions relating to prioritycontained in that Act shall apply in determiningthe priority of such floating charge.\u201d.\n\n433A. In this Part of this Act, the term\u201cfloating charge\u201d means, a \u201csecurity right\u201d forthe purpose of the application of the provisionsof the Secured Transactions Act, No. of 2019.\u201d.\n\n6.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\nAmendmentof section431 of theprincipalenactment.\n\nInsertion ofnew section433A in theprincipalenactment.\u201cInterpretation\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n3Companies (Amendment)\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING"
