    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Lions Clubs InternationalDistrict 306A - National Development Foundation Trust(Incorporation) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2019.\n\nShort title.\n\nPreamble.\n\nGeneralamendmentto Act, No.28 of 1986.\n\n25\n\n2Lions Clubs International District 306A - National Development Foundation Trust(Incorporation) (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n3.Every contract, agreement or other instrument ordocument whatsoever made, issued or executed prior to thedate of commencement of this Act, by or in favour of theLions Clubs International District 306A - NationalDevelopment Foundation Trust shall be deemed on and afrerthe date of commencement of this Act to be and to have beenmade issued or executed by or in favour of the expressionLions Clubs International District 306A - NationalDevelopment Foundation Trust, the expression \u201cLions ClubsInternational District, 306A 1, District 306A 2 - NationalDevelopment Foundation Trust\u201d.\n\n4.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nSaving forcontracts etc.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\nLions Clubs International District 306A - National Development Foundation Trust(Incorporation) (Amendment)\n\n3\n\nDepartment of Government Printing"
