    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of October 11, 2019\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 11.10. 2019)\n\nNATIONAL MINIMUM WAGE OF WORKERS(AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto amend the National Minimum Wage of Workers Act, No. 3 of 2016\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Labourand Trade Union Relations\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 3 of the National Minimum Wage of Workers Act,No. 3 of 2016 and the legal effect of the section as amended is to increase the nationalminimum monthly wage and the national minimum daily wage of a worker in any industryor service to twelve thousand five hundred rupees and five hundred rupees respectively.\n\nNational Minimum Wage of Workers (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 25/2019\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE NATIONAL MINIMUM WAGE OF WORKERSACT, NO. 3 OF 2016\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the National MinimumWage of Workers (Amendment) Act, No. of 2019.\n\n2.Section 3 of the National Minimum Wage of WorkersAct, No. 3 of 2016 is hereby amended in subsection (1) thereofby the substitution for the words \u201cshall be ten thousandrupees and the national minimum daily wage of a workershall be four hundred rupees.\u201d of the words \u201cshall be twelvethousand five hundred rupees and the national minimumdaily wage of a worker shall be five hundred rupees.\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendmentof section 3of Act, No.3of 2016.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase of anyinconsistency.\n\n2National Minimum Wage of Workers (Amendment)\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING"
