    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of October 11, 2019\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 15.10.2019 )\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nTOBACCO TAX (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Tobacco Tax Act, No. 08 of 1999\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. (Dr) Wijeyadasa Rajapakshe, M.P.for Colombo District\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\n1Tobacco Tax (Amendment)\n\nShort title.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE TOBACCO TAX ACT, NO. 08 OF 1999\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Tobacco Tax(Amendment) Act, No. of 2019.\n\n2.Section 15 of the Principal Act is hereby amended byrepealing sub-section 15 (1) of the said Act and by thesubstitution of the following paragraph:-\n\n\u201c15. (1) Every person is guilty of an offence underthis Act shall on conviction after summary trialbefore a Magistrate be liable to a fine of threetimes of the value of the goods forfeited by theDepartment of Customs or the ExciseDepartment under this Act or imprisonment ofeither description for a term not exceeding fiveyears.\u201d\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\nAmendmentof section 15of theprincipalenactment.\n\n2Tobacco Tax (Amendment)\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING"
