    "chunk_size_bytes": 1927,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nSECURED TRANSACTIONS\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 307]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Finance on 23rd of October, 2019\n\n(Published in the Gazette on August 16, 2019)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nto provide for an institutional framework for the regulation of SecuredTransactions in movable property by the establishment of the SecuredTransactions Registration Authority; to set out the powers and dutiesof such Authority; to provide for the determining of priorities amongstcreditors having competing security rights in the movable property oftheir debtors; to set out the rights and duties of parties to security agreements;to provide for the establishment and maintenance of a registry ofsecurity rights in movable property and for matters connected therewithor incidental thereto\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 85.00Postage : Rs. 35.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n1Secured Transactions\n\nShort titleand date ofoperation.5\n\n10\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 47/2015\n\nAN ACT TO PROVIDE FOR AN INSTITUTIONAL FRAMEWORK FOR THE\n\nREGULATION OF SECURED TRANSACTIONS IN MOVABLE PROPERTY BY\n\nTHE ESTABLISHMENT OF THE SECURED TRANSACTIONS REGISTRATIONAUTHORITY; TO SET OUT THE POWERS AND DUTIES OF SUCH AUTHORITY;\n\nTO PROVIDE FOR THE DETERMINING OF PRIORITIES AMONGST CREDITORS\n\nHAVING COMPETING SECURITY RIGHTS IN THE MOVABLE PROPERTY OF\n\nTHEIR DEBTORS; TO SET OUT THE RIGHTS AND DUTIES OF PARTIES TO\n\nSECURITY AGREEMENTS; TO PROVIDE FOR THE ESTABLISHMENT AND\n\nMAINTENANCE OF A REGISTRY OF SECURITY RIGHTS IN MOVABLE\n\nPROPERTY AND FOR MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR INCIDENTAL\n\nTHERETO\n\nBe it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-"
