    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of December 13 , 2019\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 16.12.2019)\n\nDECLARATION OF ASSETS ANDLIABILITIES (AMENDMENT)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. (Dr.) Wijeyadasa Rajapakshe,M.P. for Colombo District\n\nto amend the Declaration of Assets and Liabilities Law, No. 1 of 1975\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\n(Private Member's Bill)\n\nDeclaration of Assets and Liabilities (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE DECLARATION OF ASSETS AND LIABILITIESLAW, NO. 1 OF 1975\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Declaration of Assets andLiabilities (Amendment) Act, No. of 2019.\n\n2.Section 2 of the Principle Law is hereby amended byrepealing sub-section 2 (1) of the said Law and by thesubstitution of the following paragraphs:-\n\n\u201c2. (1) The Provisions of this Law shall apply to everyperson belonging to anyone of the followingclasses or descriptions of persons:-\n\n(a)the President of the Republic;\n\n(b)the Speaker of the Parliament;\n\n(c)the Ministers of the Cabinet of Ministers,other Ministers and Deputy Ministers;\n\n(d)Members of Parliament;\n\n(e)Judges and public officers appointed bythe President; public officers appointedby the Cabinet of Ministers;\n\n(f)Members of the Constitutional Councilwho are not Members of Parliamentappointed in terms of Article 41A (1) (e) ofthe Constitution;\n\n(g)Members of the Commissions referred toin the schedule to the Article 41B of theConstitution and all members of any other\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nShort title.\n\n2Declaration of Assets and Liabilities (Amendment)\n\ncommission appointed by the Presidentwith the approval of the ConstitutionalCouncil;"
