    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of December 13, 2019\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 18.12.2019)\n\nMUSLIM MARRIAGE AND DIVORCE (REPEAL)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. (Ven.) Athuraliye Rathana Thero, M.P\n\nto repeal the Muslim Marriage and Divorce Act, No. 13 of 1951\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\n(Private Member's Bill)\n\nMuslim Marriage and Divorce (Repeal)1\n\n5\n\nAN ACT TO REPEAL THE MUSLIM MARRIAGE AND DIVORCEACT, NO. 13 OF 1951\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Muslim Marriage andDivorce (Repeal) Act, No. of 2019.\n\n2.The Muslim Marriage and Divorce Act, No. 13 of1951 is hereby repealed.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\nRepeal ofAct, No. 13of 1951.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\n2Muslim Marriage and Divorce (Repeal)\n\nDepartment of Government Printing"
