    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of February 07, 2020\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 10.02.2020)\n\nFINANCE (AMENDMENT)\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Finance, Economic andPolicy Development\n\nto amend the Finance Act, No. 35 of 2018\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 36 of the Finance Act, No. 35 of 2018 and thelegal effect of the section as amended is to terminate the levying of Debt Repayment Levywith effect from January 1, 2020.\n\nFinance (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 3/2020\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE FINANCE ACT, NO. 35 OF 2018\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Finance (Amendment)Act, No. of 2020.\n\n2.Section 36 of the Finance Act, No. 35 of 2018 is herebyamended in subsection (1) thereof, by the substitution for thewords and figures \u201cending on December 31, 2021,\u201d of thewords and figures \u201cending on December 31, 2019,\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendmentof section 36of Act,No. 35 of2018.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\n2Finance (Amendment)\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING"
