    "chunk_text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Value Added Tax(Amendment) Act, No. of 2020.\n\n2.Section 3 of the Value Added Tax Act, No. 14 of2002 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) ishereby amended in paragraph (f) of subsection (1) as follows:-\n\n(2)by the insertion immediately after sub-paragraph(iv) of the following new sub-paragraph :-\n\n\u201c(v) seventy five million, for any such period ofthree months commencing on and after January1, 2020,\u201d.\n\n3.Section 10 of the principal enactment is herebyamended as follows :-\n\n(1)in subsection (1) of that section-\n\n(a)by the substitution in paragraph (v), for thewords and figures \u201con or after April 1, 2016,carries on\u201d of the words and figures \u201con andafter April 1, 2016, but prior to January 1,2020, carries on\u201d;\n\nShort title.\n\n25\n\nAmendmentof section 3of Act,No.14 of2002.\n\nAmendmentof section 10of theprincipalenactment.\n\n2Value Added Tax (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(b)by the insertion immediately after paragraph(v), of the following new paragraph:-\n\n\u201c(vi) on and after January 1, 2020, carries onor carries out any taxable activity in SriLanka shall be registered under this Act,if \u2014\n\n(a) at the end of any taxable period ofone month or three months, as thecase may be, the total value of thetaxable supplies of goods orservices or goods and services ofsuch person, made in Sri Lanka inthat taxable period of one month orthree months, as the case may be,has seventy five million rupees; or\n\n(b) in the twelve months period thenending, the total value of the taxablesupplies of goods or services orgoods and services of such person,made in Sri Lanka has exceededthree hundred million rupees; or"
